OL,4,CFive Russian military jets hit in      
OL,5,Cairfield strike, says Ukraine          
OL,6,GUkraine has said it damaged five       
OL,7,GRussian military aircraft in an attack 
OL,8,Gon Russia's Savasleyka airfield, 300km 
OL,9,G(185 miles) east of Moscow.            
OL,11,FThree MiG-31 and two Su-34s aircraft   
OL,12,Fwere hit, Kyiv's General Staff said,   
OL,13,Fadding that the extent of the damage   
OL,14,Fwas still being assessed but that      
OL,15,F"there may be even better news to      
OL,16,Fcome". It did not elaborate on what    
OL,17,Fweapons it had used to hit the         
OL,18,Fairfield.                              
OL,20,FRussia has not commented on the        
OL,21,Fstrikes.                               
